{"id":"vod_jy_44389","vodId":"44389","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"龙珠超","name_cn":"龙珠超","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第131集","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/c9128edb59deabafcc4886baef849ee1.jpg"},"summary":"结束了与魔人布欧的惨烈之战后，多灾多难的地球重归和平，而作为救世主存在的孙君（野泽雅子 配音）还生人间，和家人们过着无忧无虑的快乐生活。这边厢Z战士们安享太平，遥远的宇宙最深处，一个可怕的神明悠然苏醒。他是破坏神比鲁斯（山寺宏一 配音），嗜好美食又无比任性，稍有不满意的地方便面不改色地摧毁一颗星球以及上面的生命，堪称是界王神都不敢轻易招惹的可怕神明。受一个神秘之梦的侵扰，比鲁斯决定寻找强大的对手比试一番。他和随从维斯（森田成一 配音）来到了地球。孙悟空和伙伴们面临前所未有的挑战，而他将朝着神的境界全力冲刺……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-11-23 15:05:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":131,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/PdRn84Ld/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/ZdPl6Xzd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/9av5mOVe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbq5AP3b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xe7zDvwd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/kaz5q2re/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Qe1qVm3e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/wdLDAXgd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/mbkK6Jxb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QdJAEGDb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/oeEv6OKa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xboKApNb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/NbWvjOXa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/0dNj5DKd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Le3vKRnd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Pe9BL64a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xboKApzb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"